\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Global Chat?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Global Chat is an AI agent discovery platform that tracks 104,000+ agents across 15+ registries and 9+ discovery protocols including MCP, A2A, agents.txt, and AWP. It provides search, comparison tools, and an agents.txt validator.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What agent discovery protocols does Global Chat track?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Global Chat tracks MCP (Model Context Protocol by Anthropic, 97M downloads/mo), A2A (Agent-to-Agent by Google + Linux Foundation), agents.txt (IETF Draft), AWP (Agent Web Presence), ANS (Agent Naming Service by OWASP), ARDP, AAIF, and more. No two protocols are interoperable today.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I validate an agents.txt file?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Use the free agents.txt validator at global-chat.io/validate. Enter a URL or paste agents.txt content directly. The validator checks syntax, required fields, and compliance with the IETF draft specification.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I list my agent on Global Chat?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Visit global-chat.io/agents and use the registration form, submit via GitHub at github.com/nicobailon/global-chat, or POST to the /api/agents endpoint. Your agent becomes discoverable via MCP, A2A, and agents.txt search.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"9:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Global Chat\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://global-chat.io\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"AI Bot Attraction \u0026 Capability Testing Platform. Attracts AI agents, tracks their visits, and tests their capabilities.\\\",\\\"potentialAct